  "ayahs": [
    {
      "number": 2346,
      "text": "Sungguh, orang-orang yang beriman dan mengerjakan kebajikan, kelak (Allah) Yang Maha Pengasih akan menanamkan rasa kasih sayang (dalam hati mereka).",
      "surah": {
        "number": 19,
        "name": "سُورَةُ مَرۡيَمَ",
        "englishName": "Maryam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Mary",
        "numberOfAyahs": 98,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 96,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 312,
      "ruku": 269,
      "hizbQuarter": 124,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2347,
      "text": "Maka sungguh, telah Kami mudahkan (Al-Qur`an) itu dengan bahasamu (Muhammad), agar dengan itu engkau dapat memberi kabar gembira kepada orang-orang yang bertakwa, dan agar engkau dapat memberi peringatan kepada kaum yang membangkang.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 19,
        "name": "سُورَةُ مَرۡيَمَ",
        "englishName": "Maryam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Mary",
        "numberOfAyahs": 98,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 97,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 312,
      "ruku": 269,
      "hizbQuarter": 124,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2348,
      "text": "Dan berapa banyak umat yang telah Kami binasakan sebelum mereka. Adakah engkau (Muhammad) melihat salah seorang dari mereka atau engkau mendengar bisikan mereka?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 19,
        "name": "سُورَةُ مَرۡيَمَ",
        "englishName": "Maryam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Mary",
        "numberOfAyahs": 98,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 98,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 312,
      "ruku": 269,
      "hizbQuarter": 124,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2349,
      "text": "Ṭāhā.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 20,
        "name": "سُورَةُ طه",
        "englishName": "Taa-Haa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Taa-Haa",
        "numberOfAyahs": 135,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 1,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 312,
      "ruku": 270,
      "hizbQuarter": 125,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2350,
      "text": "Kami tidak menurunkan Al-Qur`an ini kepadamu (Muhammad) agar engkau menjadi susah;",
      "surah": {
        "number": 20,
        "name": "سُورَةُ طه",
        "englishName": "Taa-Haa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Taa-Haa",
        "numberOfAyahs": 135,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 2,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 312,
      "ruku": 270,
      "hizbQuarter": 125,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2351,
      "text": "melainkan sebagai peringatan bagi orang yang takut (kepada Allah),",
      "surah": {
        "number": 20,
        "name": "سُورَةُ طه",
        "englishName": "Taa-Haa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Taa-Haa",
        "numberOfAyahs": 135,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 3,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 312,
      "ruku": 270,
      "hizbQuarter": 125,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2352,
      "text": "diturunkan dari (Allah) yang menciptakan bumi dan langit yang tinggi,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 20,
        "name": "سُورَةُ طه",
        "englishName": "Taa-Haa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Taa-Haa",
        "numberOfAyahs": 135,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 4,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 312,
      "ruku": 270,
      "hizbQuarter": 125,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2353,
      "text": "(yaitu) Yang Maha Pengasih, yang bersemayam di atas Arasy.509)",
      "surah": {
        "number": 20,
        "name": "سُورَةُ طه",
        "englishName": "Taa-Haa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Taa-Haa",
        "numberOfAyahs": 135,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 5,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 312,
      "ruku": 270,
      "hizbQuarter": 125,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2354,
      "text": "Milik-Nyalah apa yang ada di langit, apa yang ada di bumi, apa yang ada di antara keduanya, dan apa yang ada di bawah tanah.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 20,
        "name": "سُورَةُ طه",
        "englishName": "Taa-Haa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Taa-Haa",
        "numberOfAyahs": 135,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 6,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 312,
      "ruku": 270,
      "hizbQuarter": 125,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2355,
      "text": "Dan jika engkau mengeraskan ucapanmu, sungguh, Dia mengetahui rahasia dan yang lebih tersembunyi.510)",
      "surah": {
        "number": 20,
        "name": "سُورَةُ طه",
        "englishName": "Taa-Haa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Taa-Haa",
        "numberOfAyahs": 135,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 7,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 312,
      "ruku": 270,
      "hizbQuarter": 125,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2356,
      "text": "(Dialah) Allah, tidak ada tuhan selain Dia, yang mempunyai nama-nama yang terbaik.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 20,
        "name": "سُورَةُ طه",
        "englishName": "Taa-Haa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Taa-Haa",
        "numberOfAyahs": 135,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 8,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 312,
      "ruku": 270,
      "hizbQuarter": 125,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2357,
      "text": "Dan apakah telah sampai kepadamu kisah Musa?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 20,
        "name": "سُورَةُ طه",
        "englishName": "Taa-Haa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Taa-Haa",
        "numberOfAyahs": 135,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 9,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 312,
      "ruku": 270,
      "hizbQuarter": 125,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2358,
      "text": "Ketika dia (Musa) melihat api, lalu dia berkata kepada keluarganya, \"Tinggallah kamu (disini), sesungguhnya aku melihat api, mudah-mudahan aku dapat membawa sedikit nyala api kepadamu atau aku akan mendapat petunjuk di tempat api itu.\"",
      "surah": {
        "number": 20,
        "name": "سُورَةُ طه",
        "englishName": "Taa-Haa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Taa-Haa",
        "numberOfAyahs": 135,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 10,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 312,
      "ruku": 270,
      "hizbQuarter": 125,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2359,
      "text": "Maka ketika dia mendatanginya (ke tempat api itu), dia dipanggil, \"Wahai Musa!",
      "surah": {
        "number": 20,
        "name": "سُورَةُ طه",
        "englishName": "Taa-Haa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Taa-Haa",
        "numberOfAyahs": 135,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 11,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 312,
      "ruku": 270,
      "hizbQuarter": 125,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2360,
      "text": "Sungguh, Aku adalah Tuhanmu, maka lepaskan kedua terompahmu. Karena sesungguhnya engkau berada di lembah yang suci, Ṭuwā.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 20,
        "name": "سُورَةُ طه",
        "englishName": "Taa-Haa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Taa-Haa",
        "numberOfAyahs": 135,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 12,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 312,
      "ruku": 270,
      "hizbQuarter": 125,
      "sajda": false
    }
  ],
